===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|pénkʷe}}
From {{inh|en|enm|fifthe}}, {{m|enm|fifte}}, {{m|enm|fift}}, from {{inh|en|ang|fīfta||fifth}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*fimftô||fifth}} or {{m|gem-pro|*femftô}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|five|th}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|fift}}, {{m|sco|fyft||fifth}}, {{cog|frr|fyfde||fifth}}, {{cog|fy|fyfde||fifth}}, {{cog|nl|vijfde||fifth}}, {{cog|nds|fifte}}, {{m|nds|föfte}}, {{m|nds|füfte||fifth}}, {{cog|de|fünfte||fifth}}, {{cog|da|femte||fifth}}, {{cog|sv|femte||fifth}}, {{cog|is|fimmta||fifth}}.

